L123: Supplementary S1
L124: Flow (kg DM/d):
L125: Duodenum DM flow = marker intake (g/d) / marker in duodenum (g/kg of DM)
L126: Ileal DM flow = marker intake (g/d kg of DM) / marker in ileum (g/kg of DM)
L127: Feces DM flow = marker intake (g/dkg of DM) / marker in feces (g/kg of DM)
L128: Balance (mg/d):
L129: Ruminal = intake (mg/d) – duodenal flow (mg/d)
L130: Intestinal = duodenal flow (mg/d) – ileal flow (mg/d)
L131: Hindgut = ileal flow (mg/d) – feces flow (mg/d)
L132: Feed-ilium = intake (mg/d) - ileal flow (mg/d)
L133: Total tract = intake (mg/d) - feces flow (mg/d)
L134: Digestibility (mg/g):
L135: Ruminal = intake (mg/d) – duodenal flow (mg/d) / intake (mg/d) × 1000
L136: Intestinal = duodenal flow (mg/d) – ileal flow (mg/d) / duodenal flow (mg/d) × 1000
L137: Hindgut = ileal flow (mg/d) – feces flow (mg/d) / ileal flow (mg/d) × 1000
L138: Feed-ilium = intake (mg/d) - ileal flow (mg/d) / intake (mg/d) × 1000
L139: Total tract = intake (mg/d) - feces flow (mg/d) / intake (mg/d) × 1000
